{"id":"54b4a103ae3f4dbd","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/051_扩展_Frege_证明系统_EF.md","title":"051 扩展 Frege 证明系统 EF","display":"051_扩展_Frege_证明系统_EF","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-命题公式与扩展变量\">1. 命题公式与扩展变量</h1>\n<p>命题变元集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，扩展变元集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EVar}=\\{e_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{EVar}=\\{e_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}\\cap\\mathsf{EVar}=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}\\cap\\mathsf{EVar}=\\varnothing\\)</span>。公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\cup\\mathsf{EVar}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\cup\\mathsf{EVar}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}\\cup\\mathsf{EVar})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}\\cup\\mathsf{EVar})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}(\\operatorname{atom}(a))=\\{a\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}(\\operatorname{atom}(a))=\\{a\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{EF}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\cup\\mathsf{EVar}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{EF}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\cup\\mathsf{EVar}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{EF}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{EF}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{EF}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{EF}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{EF}(\\operatorname{atom}(a),\\sigma)=\\sigma(a),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{EF}(\\operatorname{atom}(a),\\sigma)=\\sigma(a),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{EF}(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\sigma)=\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{EF}(A,\\sigma)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{EF}(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\sigma)=\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{EF}(A,\\sigma)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{EF}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\sigma)=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{EF}(A,\\sigma),\\operatorname{Sub}_{EF}(B,\\sigma)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{EF}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\sigma)=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{EF}(A,\\sigma),\\operatorname{Sub}_{EF}(B,\\sigma)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{EF}\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha^{EF}\\)</span> 为公式相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-基础-Frege-部分\">2. 基础 Frege 部分</h1>\n<p>模式语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Pat}_{EF}\">\\(\\mathsf{Pat}_{EF}\\)</span> 使用模式变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{MVar}\">\\(\\mathsf{MVar}\\)</span>、模式否定和模式蕴含生成。模式实例化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:\\mathsf{MVar}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\">\\(\\theta:\\mathsf{MVar}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\)</span> 由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{mvar}(X)\\theta=\\theta(X),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{mvar}(X)\\theta=\\theta(X),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pneg}(P)\\theta=\\operatorname{neg}(P\\theta),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pimp}(P,Q)\\theta=\\operatorname{imp}(P\\theta,Q\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pneg}(P)\\theta=\\operatorname{neg}(P\\theta),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pimp}(P,Q)\\theta=\\operatorname{imp}(P\\theta,Q\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>基础模式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{BasePat}_{EF}\">\\(\\mathsf{BasePat}_{EF}\\)</span> 由三条经典 Frege 模式组成：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y),\\operatorname{mvar}(X))),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y),\\operatorname{mvar}(X))),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pimp}(\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y),\\operatorname{mvar}(Z))),\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{mvar}(Y)),\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{mvar}(Z)))),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pimp}(\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y),\\operatorname{mvar}(Z))),\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{mvar}(Y)),\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{mvar}(Z)))),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pimp}(\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{pneg}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X)),\\operatorname{pneg}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y))),\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y),\\operatorname{mvar}(X))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pimp}(\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{pneg}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X)),\\operatorname{pneg}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y))),\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y),\\operatorname{mvar}(X))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>基础公理公式集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{EF}^{base}\n=\n\\{P\\theta:P\\in\\mathsf{BasePat}_{EF},\\theta:\\mathsf{MVar}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{EF}^{base}\n=\n\\{P\\theta:P\\in\\mathsf{BasePat}_{EF},\\theta:\\mathsf{MVar}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>基础分离规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{EF}\n=\n\\{((A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{EF}\n=\n\\{((A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-扩展定义行\">3. 扩展定义行</h1>\n<p>扩展定义是三元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(e,A,\\Delta)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(e,A,\\Delta)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathsf{EVar}\">\\(e\\in\\mathsf{EVar}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{EVar}\">\\(\\Delta\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{EVar}\\)</span> 是此前已经引入的扩展变量集合，并满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"e\\notin\\Delta,\\qquad e\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}(A),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}(A)\\cap\\mathsf{EVar}\\subseteq\\Delta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[e\\notin\\Delta,\\qquad e\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}(A),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}(A)\\cap\\mathsf{EVar}\\subseteq\\Delta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(e,A,\\Delta)\">\\((e,A,\\Delta)\\)</span> 产生两个扩展公理行：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{atom}(e),A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{atom}(e)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{atom}(e),A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{atom}(e)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记二者集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExtAx}(e,A,\\Delta)\">\\(\\operatorname{ExtAx}(e,A,\\Delta)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-EF-证明\">4. EF 证明</h1>\n<p>EF 证明是有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p:n\\to(\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\cup(\\mathsf{EVar}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\times\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{EVar})))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p:n\\to(\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\cup(\\mathsf{EVar}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\times\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{EVar})))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并伴随已引入扩展变量集合列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_k\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_0=\\varnothing\\)</span>。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&lt;n\">\\(k&lt;n\\)</span> 满足下列一种条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)\">\\(p(k)\\)</span> 是公式且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{EF}^{base}\">\\(p(k)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{EF}^{base}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)\">\\(p(k)\\)</span> 是定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(e,A,\\Delta_k)\">\\((e,A,\\Delta_k)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExtOK}_{EF}(e,A,\\Delta_k)\">\\(\\operatorname{ExtOK}_{EF}(e,A,\\Delta_k)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{k+1}=\\Delta_k\\cup\\{e\\}\">\\(\\Delta_{k+1}=\\Delta_k\\cup\\{e\\}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)\">\\(p(k)\\)</span> 是公式且存在此前定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(e,A,\\Delta_i)\">\\((e,A,\\Delta_i)\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)\\in\\operatorname{ExtAx}(e,A,\\Delta_i)\">\\(p(k)\\in\\operatorname{ExtAx}(e,A,\\Delta_i)\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)\">\\(p(k)\\)</span> 是公式且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j&lt;k\">\\(i,j&lt;k\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(i)=A\">\\(p(i)=A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(j)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\">\\(p(j)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)=B\">\\(p(k)=B\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExtOK}_{EF}(e,A,\\Delta)\">\\(\\operatorname{ExtOK}_{EF}(e,A,\\Delta)\\)</span> 当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathsf{EVar}\\wedge A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\wedge\n\\Delta\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{EVar}\\wedge\ne\\notin\\Delta\\wedge e\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}(A)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}(A)\\cap\\mathsf{EVar}\\subseteq\\Delta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[e\\in\\mathsf{EVar}\\wedge A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\wedge\n\\Delta\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{EVar}\\wedge\ne\\notin\\Delta\\wedge e\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}(A)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{FV}_{EF}(A)\\cap\\mathsf{EVar}\\subseteq\\Delta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义扩展集合更新函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{k+1}^{p}=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\Delta_k^{p}\\cup\\{e\\},&amp;p(k)=(e,A,\\Delta_k^{p})\\wedge \\operatorname{ExtOK}_{EF}(e,A,\\Delta_k^{p}),\\\\\n\\Delta_k^{p},&amp;\\neg\\exists e,A\\ p(k)=(e,A,\\Delta_k^{p})\\wedge \\operatorname{ExtOK}_{EF}(e,A,\\Delta_k^{p}).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{k+1}^{p}=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\Delta_k^{p}\\cup\\{e\\},&amp;p(k)=(e,A,\\Delta_k^{p})\\wedge \\operatorname{ExtOK}_{EF}(e,A,\\Delta_k^{p}),\\\\\n\\Delta_k^{p},&amp;\\neg\\exists e,A\\ p(k)=(e,A,\\Delta_k^{p})\\wedge \\operatorname{ExtOK}_{EF}(e,A,\\Delta_k^{p}).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^p=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_0^p=\\varnothing\\)</span>。定义行许可谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{EF}(p,k)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\bigl(p(k)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\wedge p(k)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{EF}^{base}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\vee \\exists e,A\\bigl(p(k)=(e,A,\\Delta_k^p)\\wedge \\operatorname{ExtOK}_{EF}(e,A,\\Delta_k^p)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\vee \\exists i&lt;k\\ \\exists e,A,\\Delta\\bigl(p(i)=(e,A,\\Delta)\\wedge p(k)\\in\\operatorname{ExtAx}(e,A,\\Delta)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\vee \\exists i,j&lt;k\\ \\exists A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\n\\bigl(p(i)=A\\wedge p(j)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\wedge p(k)=B\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{EF}(p,k)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\bigl(p(k)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\wedge p(k)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{EF}^{base}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\vee \\exists e,A\\bigl(p(k)=(e,A,\\Delta_k^p)\\wedge \\operatorname{ExtOK}_{EF}(e,A,\\Delta_k^p)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\vee \\exists i&lt;k\\ \\exists e,A,\\Delta\\bigl(p(i)=(e,A,\\Delta)\\wedge p(k)\\in\\operatorname{ExtAx}(e,A,\\Delta)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\vee \\exists i,j&lt;k\\ \\exists A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\n\\bigl(p(i)=A\\wedge p(j)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\wedge p(k)=B\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{EF}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(\nn&gt;0\\wedge\np:n\\to(\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\cup(\\mathsf{EVar}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\times\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{EVar})))\\wedge\n\\forall k&lt;n\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{EF}(p,k)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{EF}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(\nn&gt;0\\wedge\np:n\\to(\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\cup(\\mathsf{EVar}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\times\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{EVar})))\\wedge\n\\forall k&lt;n\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{EF}(p,k)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>EF 主判断 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{EF}A\">\\(\\vdash_{EF}A\\)</span> 在第 7 节由证明谓词和最后公式项谓词共同定义。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-大小\">5. 大小</h1>\n<p>公式大小由构造子计数定义。定义行大小为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|(e,A,\\Delta)|=1+|A|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|(e,A,\\Delta)|=1+|A|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证明大小是全部公式行与定义行大小之和。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-行许可谓词\">6. 行许可谓词</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BaseLine}_{EF}(B)\">\\(\\operatorname{BaseLine}_{EF}(B)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{EF}^{base}\">\\(B\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{EF}^{base}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExtDefLine}_{EF}(e,A,\\Delta)\">\\(\\operatorname{ExtDefLine}_{EF}(e,A,\\Delta)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExtOK}_{EF}(e,A,\\Delta)\">\\(\\operatorname{ExtOK}_{EF}(e,A,\\Delta)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExtAxLine}_{EF}(p,k,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{ExtAxLine}_{EF}(p,k,B)\\)</span> 当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists i&lt;k\\ \\exists e,A,\\Delta\\,\n\\bigl(p(i)=(e,A,\\Delta)\\wedge B\\in\\operatorname{ExtAx}(e,A,\\Delta)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists i&lt;k\\ \\exists e,A,\\Delta\\,\n\\bigl(p(i)=(e,A,\\Delta)\\wedge B\\in\\operatorname{ExtAx}(e,A,\\Delta)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MPLine}_{EF}(p,k)\">\\(\\operatorname{MPLine}_{EF}(p,k)\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j&lt;k\">\\(i,j&lt;k\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(i)=A\">\\(p(i)=A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(j)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\">\\(p(j)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)=B\">\\(p(k)=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-主判断\">7. 主判断</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{EF}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{Proof}_{EF}(p)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{LastFm}_{EF}(p,A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{EF}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{Proof}_{EF}(p)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{LastFm}_{EF}(p,A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中最后公式项谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LastFm}_{EF}(p,A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists k&lt;n\\,\n\\bigl(\np(k)=A\\wedge A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\wedge\n\\forall j&lt;n\\,(k&lt;j\\Rightarrow p(j)\\notin\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF})\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LastFm}_{EF}(p,A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists k&lt;n\\,\n\\bigl(\np(k)=A\\wedge A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\wedge\n\\forall j&lt;n\\,(k&lt;j\\Rightarrow p(j)\\notin\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF})\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>EF 定理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{EF}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}:\\vdash_{EF}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{EF}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}:\\vdash_{EF}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标特征数据与目标差异谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Feature}_{EF}\n=\n(\\mathsf{EVar},\\operatorname{ExtDefLine}_{EF},\\operatorname{ExtAx}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Feature}_{EF}\n=\n(\\mathsf{EVar},\\operatorname{ExtDefLine}_{EF},\\operatorname{ExtAx}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{EF}^{target}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Feature}_{EF}\n=(\\mathsf{EVar},\\operatorname{ExtDefLine}_{EF},\\operatorname{ExtAx})\n\\land\n\\forall e\\in\\mathsf{EVar}\\,\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\,\n\\forall\\Delta\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{EVar}\\quad\n\\operatorname{ExtOK}_{EF}(e,A,\\Delta)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ExtDefLine}_{EF}(e,A,\\Delta)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{ExtAx}(e,A,\\Delta)\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{atom}(e),A),\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{atom}(e))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{EF}^{target}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Feature}_{EF}\n=(\\mathsf{EVar},\\operatorname{ExtDefLine}_{EF},\\operatorname{ExtAx})\n\\land\n\\forall e\\in\\mathsf{EVar}\\,\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}\\,\n\\forall\\Delta\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{EVar}\\quad\n\\operatorname{ExtOK}_{EF}(e,A,\\Delta)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ExtDefLine}_{EF}(e,A,\\Delta)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{ExtAx}(e,A,\\Delta)\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{atom}(e),A),\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{atom}(e))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{EF}\n=\n(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{EVar},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF},\n\\mathsf{Pat}_{EF},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{EF},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{EF},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{EF}^{base},\n\\operatorname{ExtAx},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{EF},\n\\operatorname{BaseLine}_{EF},\n\\operatorname{ExtDefLine}_{EF},\n\\operatorname{ExtAxLine}_{EF},\n\\operatorname{MPLine}_{EF},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{EF},\n\\operatorname{LastFm}_{EF},\n|\\cdot|,\n\\vdash_{EF},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{EF},\n\\mathsf{Feature}_{EF},\n\\Delta_{EF}^{target}\n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{EF}\n=\n(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{EVar},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF},\n\\mathsf{Pat}_{EF},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{EF},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{EF},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{EF}^{base},\n\\operatorname{ExtAx},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{EF},\n\\operatorname{BaseLine}_{EF},\n\\operatorname{ExtDefLine}_{EF},\n\\operatorname{ExtAxLine}_{EF},\n\\operatorname{MPLine}_{EF},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{EF},\n\\operatorname{LastFm}_{EF},\n|\\cdot|,\n\\vdash_{EF},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{EF},\n\\mathsf{Feature}_{EF},\n\\Delta_{EF}^{target}\n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只比 Frege 增加满足无循环侧条件的扩展定义行；不含任意替换推理规则、电路求值或语义后承。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-命题公式与扩展变量","text":"1. 命题公式与扩展变量","level":1},{"id":"2.-基础-Frege-部分","text":"2. 基础 Frege 部分","level":1},{"id":"3.-扩展定义行","text":"3. 扩展定义行","level":1},{"id":"4.-EF-证明","text":"4. EF 证明","level":1},{"id":"5.-大小","text":"5. 大小","level":1},{"id":"6.-行许可谓词","text":"6. 行许可谓词","level":1},{"id":"7.-主判断","text":"7. 主判断","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{EVar}=\\{e_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}\\cap\\mathsf{EVar}=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\cup\\mathsf{EVar}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{EF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)